UPDATE companies SET description='JL Solar is a family-owned electrical company based in Odessa, Missouri, serving the Midwest with a focus on renewable energy solutions. The business is led by Shawna Lockwood as chief executive officer and James Lockwood, a master electrician with more than 25 years of experience, who serves as director of operations.

