UPDATE companies SET description='Jay Apparel Group was founded in 2009 in New York City by Jay Kapadia, who previously served as Vice President of Wovens, Fabric and Apparel at Oxford Apparel Group. At Oxford, Kapadia pioneered product development and private-label programs for retailers including Macy’s, Tommy Hilfiger, Sears, Lands’ End, and Target. He established Jay Apparel Group to bring that expertise to a broader range of global brands.

