UPDATE companies SET description='Joel Bare Woodworking operates from Bird in Hand, Pennsylvania, in the heart of Lancaster County. The shop has been producing custom wood pieces for nearly two decades, though a specific founding year is not publicly stated. Ownership details such as family or veteran status have not been disclosed.

