UPDATE companies SET description='Arcane Industries operates from Harrison, Arkansas, where it was founded in 1976. The company has grown over nearly five decades into a plastics manufacturing operation serving industrial and commercial markets. Leadership today includes Chief Executive Officer Michael Hickmon and President Jess Cole, who was appointed in a recent leadership announcement.

The company provides injection molding, extrusion, and tooling services under one roof. Its injection molding department runs machines from 60 to 1,450 tons, delivering 570,240 hours of machine time annually for both high- and low-volume component production. The extrusion line specializes in continuous-length HDPE conduit from 12 mm to 12 in., with smooth, corrugated, toneable, and cable-in-conduit configurations. An in-house tool and die shop handles CNC milling, turning, EDM, surface grinding, and heat treating, supported by veteran engineers and skilled mold makers who also manage comprehensive maintenance programs.

Arcane serves electric utility, renewable energy, irrigation, telecommunications, and data‑voice sectors with its conduit products. Its B2B stocking program supplies just‑in‑time delivery to major e‑commerce retailers such as Walmart and Amazon, as well as other industrial customers who require consistent SKU availability. The company also offers standard truckload and LTL outbound shipping.

Arcane emphasizes a combination of innovation, economical production, and sustainability, describing its approach as ''Streamlined. Smart. Sustainable.'' The stocking program was created to ensure customers never run out of top‑running SKUs, and the company states that getting precision right matters because it affects end‑use performance in demanding environments.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Injection Molding", "Plastic Extrusion", "HDPE Conduit Extrusion", "CNC Milling", "CNC Turning", "EDM (Electrical Discharge Machining)", "Surface Grinding", "Heat Treating", "Tool & Die Making", "Mold Making", "Tool Maintenance & Repair", "B2B Stocking Program", "Just-in-Time Delivery", "LTL/Truckload Shipping"], "industries": ["Electric Utility", "Renewable Energy", "Irrigation", "Telecommunications", "Data Voice", "E-commerce", "Consumer Products"], "materials": ["HDPE (High Density Polyethylene)", "Engineered resins", "Commodity resins"], "equipment": [], "volume": "High and low volume component manufacturing", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["B2B stocking program with just-in-time delivery for top-running SKUs", "Injection molding capacity from 60 to 1,450 tons (570,240 machine hours/year)", "In-house tool and die shop with CNC milling, turning, EDM, surface grinding, and heat treating", "HDPE conduit extrusion in sizes from 12\u202fmm to 12\u202fin. with custom configurations", "Sustainability-focused manufacturing using engineered and commodity resins"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1976 -> db", "Headquarters Harrison, Arkansas -> db", "Injection molding 60-1450 tons -> /", "570,240 machine hours annually -> capabilities list", "HDPE conduit 12mm to 12 inches -> /", "Industries: electric utility, renewables, irrigation, telecom, data -> /", "Tooling: CNC milling, turning, EDM, surface grinding, heat treating -> /", "Stocking program for Walmart, Amazon -> capabilities list", "Leadership: Michael Hickmon CEO, Jess Cole President