UPDATE companies SET description='Jordan Manufacturing Company was founded in 1975 by Dave Jordan in the basement of his Peoria, Illinois home. The business relocated to Monticello, Indiana in 1985 and has remained family‑owned and operated ever since. In 2021, founder Dave Jordan was succeeded by his daughter, Ashley Budd, continuing the second‑generation leadership.

The company produces a broad line of outdoor soft goods, including patio furniture cushions, throw pillows, poufs, and market umbrellas. Manufacturing is vertically integrated: fiber batting fill is produced in‑house, custom designs are developed on site, and cut‑and‑sew operations run at facilities in Monticello and Kentland, Indiana, as well as in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam. The Monticello campus includes a state‑of‑the‑art plant built in 2005 after a fire, and the Kentland facility opened in 2018.

A dropship program launched in 1999 supports online retailers, while custom product development helps brands differentiate their assortments.

The company emphasizes ethical and sustainable practices. All facilities are Sedex members and SMETA compliant, and the business earned Global Recycle Standard (GRS) certification in 2022. Vertical integration and proprietary equipment are cited as the basis for competitive pricing and fast turnaround, allowing Jordan to offer customized solutions without sacrificing quality.', certifications=ARRAY['Global Recycle Standard (GRS)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Cut-and-sew manufacturing", "Fiber batting fill production", "Custom design and pattern development", "Dropship fulfillment", "Outdoor cushion and pillow manufacturing", "Market umbrella manufacturing", "Pouf manufacturing"], "industries": ["Outdoor furniture and accessory industry", "Online retail", "Home furnishings"], "materials": ["Premium outdoor fabrics", "Fiber batting fill"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated manufacturing from fiber fill to finished goods", "Sedex member with SMETA\u2011compliant facilities worldwide", "Global Recycle Standard (GRS) certified since 2022", "Dropship fulfillment program for online retailers", "In\u2011house custom design and pattern development"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1975 by Dave Jordan in Peoria, Illinois -> /about-us", "Relocated to Monticello, Indiana in 1985 -> /about-us", "Family-owned and operated -> /about-us", "CEO succession to Ashley Budd in 2021 -> /about-us", "Products: patio cushions, throw pillows, poufs, market umbrellas -> /", "Vertically integrated process with in-house fiber batting fill production -> /about-us", "Cut-and-sew facility in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam opened 2012 -> /about-us", "Facilities in Monticello and Kentland, Indiana -> /about-us", "State-of-the-art plant built in Monticello 2005 -> /about-us", "Kentland, Indiana facility opened 2018 -> /about-us", "Sedex member, SMETA compliant -> /about-us", "Global Recycle Standard (GRS) certification earned 2022 -> /a