UPDATE companies SET description='KC Cable Connections, LLC was founded in 2011 in Independence, Missouri. The company set out to become a leader in mainline communication projects, emphasizing safety and quality above all else.

The firm specializes in all aspects of communication construction, operating as a full turn-key provider for outside plant builds.

