UPDATE companies SET description='KFK Seasonings operates from its headquarters in Portland, Oregon. The company was founded with the vision of supplying first-class seasonings and blending services to institutions and food processors nationwide. No founding year or founders are disclosed; the business is organized as a limited liability company.

